<title>UK: GECC sets 15 billion drachma Eurobond.</title>
<headline>GECC sets 15 billion drachma Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    15 BLN GRD    COUPON     9.50	MATURITY    17.MAR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.983   PAY DATE    17.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    99.983    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/GR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
